rom GPU to infrastructure to supply chain to the newest prompt injection attacks is now scored and prioritized through the same true TruRisk that powers the risk operations center.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/08/11/qualys-qlys-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"QLYS 2026 Q3","e":"qlys","d":"2026-11-09","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Sumedh Thakar","x":"Seeking to streamline operations, the agency ran a highly competitive process and selected Qualys to help activate its ROC on a single FedRAMP high authorized platform.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/11/10/qualys-qlys-q3-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"QLYS 2026 Q3","e":"qlys","d":"2026-11-09","l":"ai_disruption","r":"management","s":"Sumedh Thakar","x":"Within 10 minutes of Microsoft publishing this advisory, Agent Insta, powered by InstaScan, posted scanless detections in a customer's environment, giving them an immediate view of their exposure, no scan cycle, no agent disruption, no days-long wait, the detection at AI speed.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/11/10/qualys-qlys-q3-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"}],"trends":{"theater":[[36,1,10358,0,0,0,8654,1183],[37,1,10852,0,0,0,8950,1392],[38,1,11365,0,0,0,8781,2067],[39,1,8600,0,0,0,7313,843],[40,1,9562,0,0,0,8506,709],[41,1,6363,0,0,0,5797,360],[42,1,8927,0,0,0,7027,1500],[44,1,9066,0,0,0,7436,1132],[45,1,7917,0,0,0,6517,1069],[46,1,5696,0,0,0,5077,308],[47,1,5004,0,0,0,4446,122],[59,1,9620,0,0,0,7915,1409],[62,1,9475,0,0,0,7738,1369],[64,1,9694,0,0,0,8507,842],[65,1,9365,1,1,0,7787,1338],[66,1,9570,0,0,0,7624,1621],[67,1,9801,0,0,0,8156,1319]],"cinema":[[36,1,10358,0,0,0,8654,1183],[37,1,10852,0,0,0,8950,1392],[38,1,11365,0,0,0,8781,2067],[39,1,8600,0,0,0,7313,843],[40,1,9562,0,0,0,8506,709],[41,1,6363,0,0,0,5797,360],[42,1,8927,0,0,0,7027,1500],[44,1,9066,0,0,0,7436,1132],[45,1,7917,0,0,0,6517,1069],[46,1,5696,1,1,0,5077,308],[47,1,5004,0,0,0,4446,122],[